      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 2.96,
      "end": 5.08,
      "text": "十年的外包老板给我倒苦水",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 5.08,
      "end": 8.32,
      "text": "去年奥运业交付接了150万的这个项目",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 8.32,
      "end": 9.8,
      "text": "住场开发干了七个月",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 9.8,
      "end": 12.8,
      "text": "年底一算账倒贴回去四十万",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 12.8,
      "end": 14.56,
      "text": "其实他最扎心的不是说亏钱",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 14.56,
      "end": 15.84,
      "text": "是客户想跟他削的时候",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 15.84,
      "end": 18.0,
      "text": "就把27300万的项目给他",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 19.8,
      "text": "他直接犹豫了一个星期",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 19.8,
      "end": 20.48,
      "text": "剧掉了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 20.48,
      "end": 23.4,
      "text": "为什么FD交付这个生意越来越难看",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 23.4,
      "end": 25.24,
      "text": "那接下来我会说到三个点",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 25.24,
      "end": 28.28,
      "text": "第三个点是病根前两个点都是症状",
      "avg_logprob": -0.22117809153891899,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.17893151938915253
    },
    {
      "start": 28.28,
      "end": 29.16,
      "text": "先说清楚",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 29.16,
      "end": 31.8,
      "text": "这个生意亏钱绝对不是因为团队不行",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 31.8,
      "end": 34.2,
      "text": "绝大多数人根本就不是个FD的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 34.2,
      "end": 35.84,
      "text": "是换了一个马侠的外包",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 35.84,
      "end": 37.48,
      "text": "在FD圈子里面问了一圈",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 37.48,
      "end": 40.84,
      "text": "做AI交付的真正赚到钱的真是缝毛领袖",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 40.84,
      "end": 41.76,
      "text": "这句话特别难听",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 41.76,
      "end": 43.88,
      "text": "但你去打清打听10个",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 43.88,
      "end": 45.24,
      "text": "89个都是这个答案",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 45.24,
      "end": 48.12,
      "text": "那第一个点客户买的根本就不是开发",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 48.12,
      "end": 50.08,
      "text": "很多客户自己都没有明白问题",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 50.08,
      "end": 50.68,
      "text": "道理是什么",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 50.68,
      "end": 53.2,
      "text": "想把想明白这个事打包给卖给你",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 53.2,
      "end": 54.76,
      "text": "那我们团队自己统计过",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 54.76,
      "end": 57.52,
      "text": "去年上门谈的客户差不多有三成",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1646211194754833,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0037558514159172773
    },
    {
      "start": 57.56,
      "end": 60.76,
      "text": "聊了三四轮之后发现这个需求根本就不成立",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1618371157377374,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.031641483306884766
    },
    {
      "start": 60.76,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "他要的根本就不是言是有人替他拍板",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1618371157377374,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.031641483306884766
    },
    {
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 65.84,
      "text": "那这种单子聊一个黄一个",
